{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_scientist_01_01",
      "hash": "514b6d4ef4dcd574",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这个月正在举办\\n宇宙博览会。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_juvenilem_01_01",
      "hash": "10f7633cdae62c4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "月之石啊……\\c\\n和那边那些石头相比\\n到底哪里不一样啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_oldm_01_01",
      "hash": "b1922d572e9219a6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "人类首次踏上月球！\\c\\n一眨眼已经过了好几十年……\\c\\n接下来人类计划要去的\\n则是更加遥远的红色星球！\\c\\n无论何时，\\n宇宙的新闻都能让我兴奋不已！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_juveniles_01_01",
      "hash": "5cb2366d0b013951",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我呀就是觉得[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\n好可爱，就是好想要嘛～\\c\\n爸爸求求你了，\\n帮我捉一只回来嘛～"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_fat_01_01",
      "hash": "66105d63106ee55d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了好了！\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)]对吧！下次吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_fat_01_02",
      "hash": "66105a63106ee044",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你和你的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]……\\n以后似乎会变得更要好啊。\\r\\n这样确实不适合问你要了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_fat_01_03",
      "hash": "66105b63106ee1f7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]……\\n哎，它和你那么亲近，\\r\\n我也确实不好意思问你要啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_tenji_01",
      "hash": "921e27ae1e5adf7e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "航天飞机"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_tenji_02",
      "hash": "921e26ae1e5addcb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "飞落到月见山上的物体\\n可能就是……月之石"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_tenji_03",
      "hash": "921e25ae1e5adc18",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是一个写着\\n“宇宙地图”的3D投影！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_tenji_04",
      "hash": "921e2cae1e5ae7fd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "陨石的碎片"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_tenji_05",
      "hash": "921e2bae1e5ae64a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "宇宙的起源"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_bg_01",
      "hash": "1bd115a03a3feafd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "参观路线"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_bg_02",
      "hash": "1bd112a03a3fe5e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "从显微镜里\\n看到了漂亮的结晶！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_max",
      "hash": "593271a4df38e148"
    }
  ]
}
